McCann Kyiv (Client – Vodafone, Unicef, Carlsberg)  
Role: Senior Account/Project Manager  

Core Responsibilities:  
• Coordinated and managed projects at all stages;  
• Oversaw TVC (local shooting), OOH, and video production;  
• Conducted tenders, briefings, and collaborated with vendors; managed budgeting, payment terms, and timelines;  
• Worked with internal creative teams, selected resources for project implementation, and ensured control and coordination;  
• Prepared daily, weekly, and monthly reports for clients and agency;  
• Managed financial data control.  

Cheil Ukraine (Samsung Electronics Ukraine)  
Role: Project Manager  

Core Responsibilities:  
• Coordinated and managed projects at all stages;  
• Oversaw TVC, OOH, Retail (POSM), digital, BTL, and video adaptation;  
• Conducted tenders, briefings, and collaborated with vendors; managed budgeting, payment terms, and timelines;  
• Worked with internal agency teams, selected resources for project implementation, and ensured control and coordination;  
• Prepared daily, weekly, and monthly reports for clients and agency;  
• Managed financial data control.

LIMS Specialist at TerraLab IT, LTD, Khmelnytskyi, Ukraine  
June 2014 – December 2021  

**Project Implementation:**  
- Gathering and analysis of user requirements;  
- Contributing to designing of LIMS implementation plans;  
- Configuration and maintenance of database management systems;  
- Input of reference laboratory data;  
- LIMS configurations and settings;  
- Connection and setting of laboratory equipment;  
- Report design using FastReport software;  
- Training of the end users, developing user guides and manuals;  
- Laboratory support.  

**Project Support and Maintenance:**  
- Maintenance of laboratory information management systems;  
- Configurations and system administration of software;  
- Software and database maintenance;  
- Initial diagnostics of user technical issues;  
- Resolving user questions and issues;  
- Assisting the development team with software process improvement;  
- Design of printing forms and reports;  
- Onsite client consulting.  

**Project Integration and Maintenance:**  
- Develop integration solutions;  
- Implement new and existing integration solutions;  
- Configuring, customizing, and developing new solutions;  
- Participate in technical integration planning and presales discussions;  
- Gathering requirements for new solutions;  
- Troubleshoot code and configuration issues in all managed environments;  
- Effectively communicate across many channels with team and stakeholders.

Manager with solid business experience, with 8 years of experience in the telecom sector, mainly focused on enterprise large systems. Developed new solutions from idea to successful implementation.  

**Work Experience:**  

**NDA, Chief Operating Officer, Ukraine (Sept. '20 - Present)**  
Responsibilities:  
- Management and control of the operating activities of the company and its divisions;  
- Formation of strategic goals, development and implementation of business plans, assessment of possible risks, optimization of business processes;  
- Achieving strategic goals;  
- Working with a team, building processes;  
- Product promotion.  

**NDA, Project Manager, Scrum Master, Ukraine (Mar. '20 - Sept. '20)**  
Responsibilities:  
- Management of the company's financial result;  
- Monitoring the execution of budgets and the company's cost optimization plan;  
- Ensuring the smooth operation of the company: telemarketing, order processing service, design department, IT, accounting and finance;  
- Quality control of performance of works according to service contracts;  
- Attracting new clients, projects to the company, and launching them;  
- Effective communication with customers;  
- Daily coordination of the work of employees, setting tasks, deadlines and monitoring their implementation;  
- Development and control of the application of regulatory documents: instructions, rules, standards, contracts;  
- Record keeping, internal reporting;  
- Working with a team, building processes;  
- Product promotion.  

**Head of Sales Department, Ukraine (Sept. '18 - Mar. '20)**  

**TeamLead, Dealer Department, Kharkiv, Ukraine (Apr. '16 - Sept. '18)**  

**Head of Corporate Sales, Eastern Region, Ukraine (Nov. '09 - Apr. '16)**  

It is always important for me to work with people who are positively disposed and ready to go jointly to the set goals, to achieve them, to enjoy joint achievements.
